{"name":"Hidcote","hex":"#9c949b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Hidcote Bartrim","blocks":[{"text":"Hidcote Bartrim is a hamlet in the civil parish of Ebrington, in the Cotswold district of Gloucestershire, England. The nearest town is Chipping Campden, which is approximately 2.75 miles (4.43 km) south-west from the village. The village is on the Gloucestershire-Warwickshire border. It should not be confused with Hidcote Boyce, a similarly sized village roughly 0.5 miles (0.8 km) south of Hidcote Bartrim."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Thatched_cottages%2C_Hidcote_Bartrim_-_geograph.org.uk_-_138687.jpg/330px-Thatched_cottages%2C_Hidcote_Bartrim_-_geograph.org.uk_-_138687.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hidcote_Bartrim","wikidata":"Q9291967"},{"title":"Hidcote Manor Garden","blocks":[{"text":"Hidcote Manor Garden is a garden in the United Kingdom, located at the village of Hidcote Bartrim, near Chipping Campden, Gloucestershire. It is one of the best-known and most influential Arts and Crafts gardens in Britain, with its linked \"garden rooms\" of hedges, rare trees, shrubs and herbaceous borders. Created by Lawrence Johnston, it is owned by the National Trust and is open to the public."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Hidcote_Manor.jpg/330px-Hidcote_Manor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hidcote_Manor_Garden","wikidata":"Q1617307"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/SnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg/500px-SnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/SnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg/1280px-SnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/SnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg/500px-SnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Heavy snowfall can prevent access to Hidcote. Taken March 2018.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASnowHidcoteBartrimColemansHill201803020852.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/HidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg/500px-HidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/HidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg/1280px-HidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/HidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg/500px-HidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A frog in a Hidcote pond","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHidcoteBartrimFrogInPond20160611.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Hidcote34.JPG/330px-Hidcote34.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Hidcote34.JPG/330px-Hidcote34.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Plan of the garden. 1 Entrance, 2 White Garden, 3 Long Walk, 4 Red Borders, 5 Fuchsia Garden, 6 Bathing Pool Garden, 7 Theatre Lawn, 8 Stilt Garden, 9 Pillar Garden.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHidcote34.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Hidcote7.png/500px-Hidcote7.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=par